# Summarising in Russian: в тексте говорится о…, кратко
subtitle: "В тексте говорится о…, сначала, затем, таким образом: cut a Russian text to its main idea in three sentences, as Tom sums up an article about «Кухонька»."
tags: ["russian","summary in russian","изложение","trki 2","russian writing"]
teaches: ["writing/summaries","reading/reading-news"]
thumb: "band \"Say it short, in Russian\" stamp \"ИЗЛОЖЕНИЕ\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
